LOAD 1 LOADTYPE SEISMIC TITLE EQ X
1893 LOAD X 1
LOAD 2 LOADTYPE SEISMIC TITLE EQ Z
1893 LOAD Z 1
LOAD 3 LOADTYPE DEAD TITLE DL
SELFWEIGHT Y -1
MEMBER LOAD
13 TO 16 UNI GY -4.6
9 TO 12 UNI GY -11.73
FLOOR LOAD
YRANGE 2.9 3.1 FLOAD -4.125 GY
YRANGE 5.9 6.1 FLOAD -4.125 GY
LOAD 4 LOADTYPE LIVE TITLE LL
